So what role do possessions play in our lives? Why are many people driven to acquire things, especially to systematically collect items such as stamps, art, antique cars, or even matchbooks or PEZ dispensers? What does it mean to own something? To possessions have to be physical objects, or can they be digital or completely intangible? What happens when we have to give,
