And also, I don't know that, well, it's the red book over there on the third shelf, and I know if I open it to a certain page, I'm going to find something. So we access that information in a different way. We search for it and we sort of see it in a decontextualized way. And we've gotten farther than that. We have now streaming music, for example, in streaming movies. And so in place of the library of cassettes or even tapes before that, we have these things that we don't really have any tangible proof of.
而且，我不知道，嗯，那是第三层架子上的那本红书，我知道如果我翻到某一页，我就能找到某些东西。所以我们以不同的方式获取这些信息。我们搜索它，并以一种去语境化的方式看待它。我们已经走得更远了。例如，我们现在有流媒体音乐和流媒体电影。因此，取代了磁带库甚至之前的录音带，我们拥有了这些我们没有任何实物证明的东西。

