rather than being able to go to our library and pull it out and know that it's ours. And for that matter, if we have avatars in an online world or an online gaming platform, and the gaming platform shuts down for some reason, our avatar is no longer there. Now, supposedly that's going to be different in the metaverse where we have interoperability and we're able to take our avatar from one world to another.
而不是能够走到我们的图书馆把它拿出来，并知道它是属于我们的。同样，如果我们在线世界或在线游戏平台中有化身，而游戏平台因某种原因关闭了，我们的化身就不再存在了。现在，据推测，在元宇宙中情况会有所不同，我们将拥有互操作性，能够将我们的化身从一个世界带到另一个世界。

